  "description": "Bar 45 Restaurant and Bar is your local hangout for great food, cold drinks, and a laid-back vibe—right at ONE Club. Whether you're winding down after golf, catching up with friends, or just looking for a spot to watch the game, you'll find plenty of reasons to come back. Enjoy a menu filled with classic favorites and tasty bar bites, plus cold drafts, creative cocktails, and wine for every taste. We've got happy hour specials and weekly entertainment that keep the energy going, whether it's game day or just a Tuesday. #1 Sports Bar & Entertainment Venue in Gulf Shores with big screen TVs, great draft selections, and awesome bar bites. Fully stocked bar with beautiful golf course views. Game room and Media Simulator room with more than 100 simulation games, kids games, golf courses, football and more.",
